%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant LSW as Local SW
    participant L as Local AOU_CORE
    participant R as Remote AOU_CORE
    Note over L,R: ENABLED
    R->>L: DeactivateReq (every remote request answered)
    Note over L,R: DEACTIVATE
    L->>LSW: INT_DEACTIVATE_START (a hint: local managers may keep issuing)
    Note over L: stops granting request credits (a credit already committed may ride in the DeactivateAck flit)
    L->>R: DeactivateAck
    L->>R: AW/AR/W requests still issued by the local managers
    Note over L: keeps granting R/B credits after its DeactivateAck while its requests are open
    R->>L: R/B responses, sent after the remote DeactivateReq
    LSW->>L: local managers stop issuing, then DEACTIVATE_START = 1
    Note over L: waits for SLV_TR_COMPLETE = 1 and the quiet window
    L->>R: DeactivateReq
    Note over L: stops granting R/B credits
    R->>L: DeactivateAck
    Note over L,R: DISABLED: both dies discard the credits they hold
